[b]RGO Harmony: Just Goods + More Locations + Global Historical RGOs[/b]

A compatibility patch for these three mods:
[list]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3809335454]More locations Mod[/url]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3602513956]Global Historical RGOs[/url]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3785316314]Just Goods[/url]
[/list]

All three mods are required. Load them in this order, with RGO Harmony last:
[list=1]
[*]More locations Mod
[*]Global Historical RGOs
[*]Just Goods
[*]RGO Harmony
[/list]

Precedence follows the chosen conflict rules: Just Goods' explicit RGO changes win at its fixed locations; Global Historical RGOs wins over More Locations for the 1,269 agreed conflicts and 48 qualifying single-parent split locations. More Locations remains the map and RGO base everywhere else.
